      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "intended audience",
      "description": "The meme is designed to target individuals who hold or are exposed to Islamophobic and misogynistic stereotypes, particularly those who may be influenced by or reinforce harmful narratives about Muslim women and Islam's compatibility with Western values. The target audience likely includes people who are predisposed to or seek to perpetuate stereotypes that associate Islam with sexualized, commodified entertainment, or who are susceptible to anti-Muslim rhetoric that frames Muslim women as oppressed or inherently linked to sexualized performance. The meme’s hateful intent suggests it is crafted to provoke offense and reinforce prejudice among those who already harbor such biases.",
